    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TO BEGIN\nWarm roasted nuts\nserved with your preferred\ncocktail or beverage\nAPPETIZER\nLobster half with lemon\naccompanied by Du Barry sauce\nSALAD\nLollo rosso, butter lettuce and baby spinach\nwith yellow pear tomato\nand buffalo mozzarella with crushed pepper\nOffered with your choice of basil vinaigrette\nor Parmesan-pepper dressing\nFreshly baked sourdough bread and assorted rolls with butter\nMAIN COURSES\nChef's Seasonal Selection\nCreated by Award-Winning\nChef Jean-Louis Dumonet of Trois Jean Bistro,\nin New York City\nVeal Chop au Jus\nserved with mashed potatoes with black truffle\naccompanied by green asparagus spears and buttered baby carrots\nOriental Duck\nTender breast of duck enhanced by natural pan gravy\nJasmine rice\nChinese-style vegetables Fruit chutney\nSalmon\nFillet of salmon with a macadamia nut crust\nRed bell pepper julienne Papaya-mango chutney Asparagus\nPasta Bowl\nSpinach ravioli complemented by Alfredo sauce,\nwith artichoke hearts, yellow bell pepper julienne\nand diced tomatoes\nFreshly grated Parmesan cheese\nDESSERT\nHäagen-Dazs™ vanilla ice cream\noffered with your choice of toppings\nINTERNATIONAL COFFEES\nFreshly brewed\nTimothy's Custom Roasted Italian Blend Gourmet Coffee\nDecaffeinated coffee\noffered with a splash of your favorite liqueur, topped with whipped cream\nItaliano with Amaretto Royal with Cognac\nFrançais with Grand Marnier\nMexican with Kahlúa Scottish with Drambuie\nIrish with Baileys Irish Cream\nContinental Airlines"
